_:nfd0d6ad35f494168b1fb8c1ef1ee1902b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        rml:referenceFormulation must be a blank node or IRI specifying the\r\n        reference formulation on how to reference elements of a data source,\r\n        and may be provided at most once.\r\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
